ons: 0\nDuplicate governed row IDs: 0\nUnclassified governed rows: 0\nScheduled governed rows: 15,824 / 15,824\n\nFiles changed:\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/full-data-governance-inventory.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/full-data-governance-scheduler.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/full-data-governance-scheduler.readback.md`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/full-data-governance-scheduler.validator-result.json`\n\n## Source reconciliation\n\n- Eligible source anchors: 3,265\n- Reconciled ProcedureModel candidates: 571\n- Reconciled ProcedureStep candidates: 2,678\n- Anchor-to-ProcedureModel mappings: 3,265\n- Anchor-to-ProcedureStep mappings: 2,678\n- Evidence carry-forward rows after #1062: 2,141\n- ProcedureStep blockers after backfill: 587\n- Manual extraction rows: 411\n- Human semantic decision rows: 144\n- Merge/split decision rows carried from #1040: 84\n- Source unclassified gaps: 0\n\n## Scheduler outcome\n\n- fgc-002 / #1084: 2,552 direct rows\n- fgc-003 / #1085: 4,064 direct rows\n- fgc-004 / #1086: 5,943 direct rows\n- fgc-005 / #1087: 0 direct rows; consumes fgc-003/fgc-004 outputs for abstraction ledgers\n- fgc-006 / #1088: 3,265 direct rows\n- fgc-007 / #1089: 0 direct rows; consumes prior wave outputs for final consolidation\n\n## Validator outcome\n\n- Required first command in the task worktree: `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` ran first under AO before source inspection. It returned `top_status=warning` with branch-safety warning only; worktree was clean and synchronized.\n- Post-generation compact-row semantic validation: pass. `validation_status=pass`, 15,824 inventory rows, 15,824 scheduled rows, missing scheduled rows 0, extra scheduled rows 0, duplicate governed row IDs 0, source hash mismatches 0, output hash mismatches 0, unclassified rows 0.\n- JSON parse check: pass for all 3 new JSON outputs.\n- Path-boundary check over changed paths: 4 changed files, all under `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/**`, 0 violations.\n- Source mutation check: 17 consumed source artifacts checked, 0 modified.\n- `git diff --cached --check`: pass.\n- Post-commit preflight: `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` returned `top_status=warning` due only to branch-safety warning for `feat/issue-1083`; worktree clean, upstream `origin/feat/issue-1083` ahead 0 behind 0, report artifact guard healthy, A+ ratchet healthy.\n\n## Boundary confirmation\n\nThis PR is artifact/governance only. It does not promote anchors, ProcedureModels, ProcedureSteps, StrategyModels, ExamTriggers, TopicSkills, InterpretationSkills, or FailurePoints. It does not claim human acceptance. It does not mutate DB/schema/seed/UI/Supabase state or any runtime path. All candidate, blocked, manual extraction, human decision, and unserved rows remain outside served/runtime paths until a later explicit issue narrows that boundary.\n\nParent #1081 is intentionally not closed by this PR.","created_at":"2026-07-01T01:46:43Z","updated_at":"2026-07-01T01:49:50Z","closed_at":"2026-07-01T01:49:50Z","merged_at":"2026-07-01T01:49:50Z","merge_commit_sha":"9a96aaf103ebe6977911897cba13d8f360cb3fe6","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1091/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1091/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1091/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/71f740548d7a2f7a042fa6430cfbe07839e1f084","head":{"label":"Samsen879:feat/issue-1083","ref":"feat/issue-1083","sha":"71f740548d7a2f7a042fa6430cfbe07839e1f084","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1722